# Writing fonts are downloaded on demand via FontDownloader.
# Only the ones a merchant selects land here. Keeping them
# out of the repo keeps clones small and forces a fresh
# download per environment, which is the correct model for
# merchant-configurable assets.

*

# But keep this directory and its .gitkeep.
!.gitkeep
!.gitignore

# Font Awesome is bundled and versioned. Uncomment the
# exception below when Session 5 commits the four FA
# binaries under public/assets/fontawesome/.
